{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12965","headline":"山中春思 · 独孤及","name":"山中春思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"獭祭川水大，人家春日长。\n独谣昼不暮，搔首慙年芳。\n靡草知节换，含葩向新阳。\n不嫌三径深，爲我生池塘。\n亭午井竈闲，雀声响空仓。\n花落没屐齿，风动羣木香。\n归路云水外，天涯杳茫茫。\n独卷万里心，深入山鸟行。\n芳景勿相迫，春愁未遽忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}